note on mutation 3: it is the defect the harness found in the first draft of the
installer -- --status computed the host path as /var/lib/android-data$P where $P is
already /data/..., i.e. /var/lib/android-data/data/system/..., so on a device where
--install had just created the directory, --status reported NEITHER exists. The
harness reported it as a failure of the cross-check, not as a bug in itself.
